ReelNest

Selected visual constants and sidebar styling in the Flutter client are adapted
from MediaLib (https://github.com/829304/MediaLib), revision
64f8ee258d87389414d5e06740a89f59cd857612, licensed under Apache License 2.0.
The original SwiftUI implementation has been reimplemented in Dart/Flutter.
See docs/design/SOURCE_MAPPING.md for the source mapping and current scope.

Source media classifications, scan eligibility rules (extensions and size
thresholds), successful-scan index pruning, and desktop minimum content sizes
are also adapted from the same MediaLib revision. See
docs/design/ORIGINAL_PARITY_AUDIT.zh-CN.md for verified rules and remaining gaps.

Source-page title illustrations, selected linear icon paths, section/header
layout, directory reachability checks and the local scan queue are translated
from MediaLib's VividIconLibrary.swift, SourcesView.swift, FileAccessService.swift
and AppState.swift at the same revision.
